# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the walk's runs.
# valkey-json keeps flags in the high bits of its pointers, which LeakSanitizer cannot follow, so every JSON value
# still live when a server exits reads as leaked (valkey-fuzzer#48). Each pattern matches a frame's module or source
# file: every such allocation goes through the module's memory.cc.
leak:libjson.so
leak:/src/json/memory.cc
